        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                "word": "realiteit",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d607a096-985a-4702-9086-b2bda7493710",
                        "entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "realiteiten"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "cfd69789-d5b8-406b-a7ca-ced4e5249455",
                        "entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "(realiteitje)"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "2a455cd0-2082-473f-9391-3306115c5f68",
                        "entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "(realiteitjes)"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1d0fd140-8bbb-3f10-bc3b-e6b18ec93171",
                        "entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "werkelijkheid"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a310c25e-3e39-4f9f-b4d8-886c198f537f",
                                "sense_id": "1d0fd140-8bbb-3f10-bc3b-e6b18ec93171",
                                "text": "De bittere realiteit is dat de oorlog een grote chaos veroorzaakt heeft."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25ccba66-47fb-4af4-a589-2cf7fbdb72de",
                                "sense_id": "1d0fd140-8bbb-3f10-bc3b-e6b18ec93171",
                                "text": "Het was te ver verwijderd van de alledaagse werkelijkheid en de realiteit van menselijke emoties, behoeftes en imperfecties."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38bdb8ba-34d1-4106-ab41-cd917dee6ad6",
                                "sense_id": "1d0fd140-8bbb-3f10-bc3b-e6b18ec93171",
                                "text": "De VU laat aan de NOS weten te waarderen dat het werkveld erg betrokken is. \"De realiteit blijft echter dat de afdeling Aardwetenschappen langdurig te maken heeft met structurele financiële tekorten, ondanks eerdere reorganisaties en gedeeltelijk steun van andere afdelingen. Deze structurele tekorten zijn niet langer mogelijk gezien de bezuinigingsopgave waar we als faculteit, maar ook als universiteit in haar geheel, nu voor staan.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "66b73144-1556-4f4b-b8d6-8cc4ea1d7346",
                        "source_entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                        "source_sense_id": "1d0fd140-8bbb-3f10-bc3b-e6b18ec93171",
                        "target_lang_word": "reality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "reality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9db39c24-802c-38a6-a5ae-735cb3f6dcfb",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being actual or real; realness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89a35b67-8fcb-4032-85ef-4e5feeb19098",
                                                "sense_id": "9db39c24-802c-38a6-a5ae-735cb3f6dcfb",
                                                "text": "The reality of the crash scene on TV dawned upon him only when he saw the victim was no actor but his friend."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df922a23-6b94-4353-9a38-fd2ed5812d80",
                                                "sense_id": "9db39c24-802c-38a6-a5ae-735cb3f6dcfb",
                                                "text": "While the SCP universe is, of course, filled with things that we would certainly not consider \"real\", most of the SCPs are tangible or perceivable in some way. There are those concepts, however, whose reality is debatable, even to the SCP Foundation, begging them to ask the question of what, exactly, is real."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6e70ab3-9d7a-387c-9765-cbfeeed7099f",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The real world."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29f90ebf-126f-4e67-9738-1e30746d17df",
                                                "sense_id": "e6e70ab3-9d7a-387c-9765-cbfeeed7099f",
                                                "text": "A man very often fancies that he understands a critic, when in reality he does not comprehend his meaning."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb016d57-29b8-4f5c-a2cc-e337f9b51e0a",
                                                "sense_id": "e6e70ab3-9d7a-387c-9765-cbfeeed7099f",
                                                "text": "As a political system democracy seems to me extraordinarily foolish,[…]. My servant is, so far as I am concerned, welcome to as many votes as he can get.[…]I do not suppose that it matters much in reality whether laws are made by dukes or cornerboys, but I like, as far as possible, to associate with gentlemen in private life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A real entity, event, or other fact."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "663d2a1e-3a99-4d19-a84c-ff6dff9a2e35",
                                                "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                                "text": "The ultimate reality of life is that it ends in death."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ff6e2cd-92a6-40fe-a105-5fc240494d13",
                                                "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                                "text": "And to realities yield all her shows."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42e3b19f-323b-4fb6-91ea-6064f396e186",
                                                "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                                "text": "My neck, Sir, may be an idea to you, but to me it is a reality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22acda11-1e88-4632-861d-5c6fc827a652",
                                                "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                                "text": "A dream, of simple fantasy / That I, wished was reality / That you'd, come knocking at my door / And we'd, relive this dream once more"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec103abf-08b2-4931-9f1b-92673aac8050",
                                                "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                                "text": "Recent historical studies indicate that we must continue to challenge the notion that there is an unproblematic story of queer liberation. For example, how do local histories account for realities such as the increased racial segregation of the New York bar scene after Stonewall?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b344d02c-2d75-4ef2-b338-130b276c48a8",
                                                "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                                "text": "Given the economic realities of contemporary Poland, a requirement to provide information on movable assets which exceed PLN 10,000 in value cannot be held to be excessive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8822457b-fa7d-446b-925e-5a96fc8a1890",
                                                "sense_id": "8f98f49f-0cc1-3ed7-b9a6-d5ae72f7329b",
                                                "text": "It is time the international community faced the reality: we have an unmanageable, unfair, distortionary global tax regime. It is a tax system that is pivotal in creating the increasing inequality that marks most advanced countries today[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd2e1ab6-f962-35fd-845a-96894af705d3",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The entirety of all that is real."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f036330-5dcf-471b-91c4-bc687c06b1e7",
                                                "sense_id": "dd2e1ab6-f962-35fd-845a-96894af705d3",
                                                "text": "Across the entire Universe. Never stopping, never faltering, never fading. People and planets and stars will become dust. And the dust will become atoms and the atoms will become... nothing. And the wavelength will continue, breaking through the rift at the heart of the Medusa Cascade into every dimension, every parallel, every single corner of creation. This is my ultimate victory, Doctor! The DESTRUCTION! Of REALITY! ITSELF!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42e709b6-a00e-3783-af17-211426b43ad7",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An individual observer's own subjective perception of that which is real."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b56e8286-e9ed-39c5-96b5-6c93ceb88dc9",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Loyalty; devotion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f297434-d245-4494-9e41-762a0ad544f4",
                                                "sense_id": "b56e8286-e9ed-39c5-96b5-6c93ceb88dc9",
                                                "text": "To express our reality to the emperor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27e71e25-70ae-3442-9b9b-57821bf9c3fe",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Realty; real estate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70fcddfa-9f35-3528-9bbd-6e311da10bc6",
                                        "entry_id": "1e5bd644-36d0-30f5-91c3-6ca4acf00430",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Reality television."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65f4e350-cea3-4981-86b8-05223ae5cf9d",
                                                "sense_id": "70fcddfa-9f35-3528-9bbd-6e311da10bc6",
                                                "text": "a foray into reality programming"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ffce46f-eb40-48f8-9d6d-b55737c10e5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                        "source_sense_id": "1d0fd140-8bbb-3f10-bc3b-e6b18ec93171",
                        "target_lang_word": "actuality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "actuality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f85b4127-38a0-3310-a82e-74addeabd554",
                                        "entry_id": "d03fafb9-3119-3580-ae86-c34c18060965",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of existing; existence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1214183-9d7e-334c-9ff6-89c66443ee0c",
                                        "entry_id": "d03fafb9-3119-3580-ae86-c34c18060965",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance or quality of being actual or factual; fact."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2371f0ac-ec1d-475a-bb6e-4b1e1f6b86a9",
                                                "sense_id": "b1214183-9d7e-334c-9ff6-89c66443ee0c",
                                                "text": "\"It seems as though I have lived this life always. The world of books and bookish folk is very vague, more like a dream memory than an actuality. I surely have hunted and forayed and fought all the days of my life. And you, too, seem a part of it. You are -- \" I was on the verge of saying, \"my woman, my mate,\" but glibly changed it to -- \"standing the hardship well.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f3b2de6-8376-3493-a497-c7213ac53e96",
                                        "entry_id": "d03fafb9-3119-3580-ae86-c34c18060965",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Live reporting on current affairs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da845731-797f-47ba-88f3-18ed748a3bb6",
                                                "sense_id": "3f3b2de6-8376-3493-a497-c7213ac53e96",
                                                "text": "A cabled despatch is better than nothing, but a voicecast of tolerable quality is preferable, and in certain types of story a voicecast with live or recorded actuality is best of all. Correspondents all have portable tape recorders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93a3cf0f-13a7-4ef0-bba1-f2e248fec69d",
                                                "sense_id": "3f3b2de6-8376-3493-a497-c7213ac53e96",
                                                "text": "This is a news report from the scene of the event. When a voicer and an actuality are combined into one complete story, it's known as a wrap."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2ad9ea1-8238-3645-b463-8ee7070484d6",
                                        "entry_id": "d03fafb9-3119-3580-ae86-c34c18060965",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short early motion picture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e19e40a6-266f-4aab-a996-10d64817b37d",
                                                "sense_id": "e2ad9ea1-8238-3645-b463-8ee7070484d6",
                                                "text": "By 1903, the actuality film had reached its peak; in 1903, the Edison and Biograph companies, combined, registered three hundred fifty one actuality films for copyright protection. By 1908 that number had dropped to two."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "271d9f39-deea-42ef-a8ca-73f46340efc9",
                        "source_entry_id": "79c1c051-dd32-39f1-9e30-8a592b33679b",
                        "source_sense_id": "1d0fd140-8bbb-3f10-bc3b-e6b18ec93171",
                        "target_lang_word": "réalité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "réalité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6dfeab8f-0824-3936-8a8a-ba060dce79a8",
                                        "entry_id": "9a1575b9-59de-39d7-a318-65c2936ad341",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Existence effective."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6440f6b2-3f43-421d-943c-bdd1ad2b9367",
                                                "sense_id": "6dfeab8f-0824-3936-8a8a-ba060dce79a8",
                                                "text": "La réalité d’un paiement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                        "entry_id": "9a1575b9-59de-39d7-a318-65c2936ad341",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui existe effectivement, chose réelle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4dbc1fc-b3df-49c6-99a4-d4007a7b474d",
                                                "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                                "text": "Ce rappel à la réalité quotidienne et aux occupations usuelles change momentanément le cours de mes pensées."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31cfa170-5025-4f66-879b-8e48f0fd7fed",
                                                "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                                "text": "En ouvrant les yeux, je mis quelques secondes à reprendre contact avec la réalité. J’étais étendu, détaché et nu, au milieu des paras."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a04a302a-ced7-4c44-b03e-28db1438452f",
                                                "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                                "text": "La littérature érotique embrasse plus de réalités psychologiques que la morale bourgeoise ne voulait en connaître, et que le puritanisme n’en tolère. Or ces réalités, quoiqu’on en juge, sont au moins aussi quotidiennes et obsédantes que les réalités économiques, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3b6be5c-7aa8-4bd8-b146-d316bdc1be43",
                                                "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                                "text": "Tout à la fois thriller haletant et chronique d’une Amérique en crise, le dernier roman de Douglas Kennedy nous plonge dans les réalités socio-économiques d’un pays où les idéologies extrêmes s’affrontent violemment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01d0cba4-b6ba-445d-a48c-771d47bdb833",
                                                "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                                "text": "Que la réalité ne corresponde pas au rêve, seuls les naïfs s'en étonneront. D’abord, il y eut autant de rêves que de rêveurs. […]. Enfin, et surtout, si les hommes pouvaient réaliser leurs utopies, cela se saurait."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e39d9a58-43d9-4553-90fe-acfa50a53fa3",
                                                "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                                "text": "Mythologie du village français ? Oui, complètement ! C’est même drôle à quel point nous recouvrons la réalité par des métaphores et des mythes. Actuellement, ce sont l’image de la guerre et de l’abri qui dominent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c04e475-5baf-48e7-9568-a8d0bd049c7a",
                                                "sense_id": "e95a1b3a-988b-3501-bc4e-d82c6747088e",
                                                "text": "Nous créons la réalité rien qu’en existant.\nCeci est tout aussi vrai pour la chouette\nqui somnole en ce moment sur une branche."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68bebb2c-90c0-320a-af97-4e5ee9215144",
                                        "entry_id": "9a1575b9-59de-39d7-a318-65c2936ad341",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ce qui est admis pour vrai."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8144ebdb-6551-4633-a66d-32dd3e56fe71",
                                                "sense_id": "68bebb2c-90c0-320a-af97-4e5ee9215144",
                                                "text": "Avec l'expérience, il se confirme que la valeur d'une oeuvre n'est pas tant liée à sa qualité qu'au battage médiatique dont elle fait l'objet, une réalité qui m'a amené à l'unique et seule conclusion qu'il faut être populaire pour exister."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "réalité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ea9978f-3879-307c-bc7f-a3662152292e",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec65355-7aa1-3ed4-8956-48b63020fef2",
